name: turret-reach-indicator
displayName: Turret Reach Indicator
subtitle: See your turret coverage on the map
author: Tomáš Rindt
version: "1.0"
minGameVersion: "147"
repo: TousTarm/Mindustry_turret_reach_indicator_mod
description: "Shows your team's turret coverage on the map as one merged outline, so gaps in your defense are easy to spot. Filters for ground, air, ground + air, and fire-extinguishing turrets. Open the map (M) and use the Turret reach panel in the top-right corner. Client-side only: works on any server, and other players don't need it."
# client-side only: servers and other players don't need it
hidden: true
